{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32517","headline":"钓台怀古 · 刘驾","name":"钓台怀古","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"澄流可濯缨，严子但垂纶。\n孤坐九层石，远笑清渭滨。\n潜龙飞上天，四海岂无云。\n清气不零雨，安使洗尘氛。\n我来吟高风，髣髴见斯人。\n江月尚皎皎，江石亦磷磷。\n如何台下路，明日又迷津。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"刘驾","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_32517.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_32517","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}